{"articleNo":"540745","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=540745&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2025학년도 총동창회 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.10.21","hit":"3879","attachments":[{"name":"장학금 신청서.추천서.소견서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=540745&attachNo=158287"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학년도 장학생 선발 공고</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">재단법인 국립금오공과대학교 총동창회 장학회에서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학년도 장학생을 아래와 같이 선발하오니 희망하는 재학생들은 신청바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">________________________________________</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">아 래</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">____________________________________</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">접수기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: 2025</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">21</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(<font face=\"함초롬바탕\">화</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) ~ 2025</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">31</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(<font face=\"함초롬바탕\">금</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">발표안내 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">합격자에게만 개별 문자발송</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지급안내 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">장학생 개인 명의 계좌 입금</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지원자격 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">각 항에 해당되는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">복지 장학생&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">경제사정이 어려운 자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">기초생활 수급자 증명원 첨부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">공로 장학생&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">동창회 및 학생회 활동에 공로가 많은 자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;3) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">기타 장학생&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">편입생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">대학원생 제외</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">신청서 교부처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학교 홈페이지 공고 파일 다운받아 작성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">접수처 및 문의처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">총동창회 사무실 직접 방문접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">방문전 연락바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- 주소&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">구미시 구미대로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">350-27.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">신평 금오공과대학교 평생교육원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">층 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">211</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">호&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(T.054-478-6800</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">신청절차</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- 장학금 신청서 수령 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">장학금 신청서 작성</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">추천서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\